{"overview":"اکنون به‌عنوان مأمور میدانی سی‌آی‌ای، بکی به‌صورت مخفی به لهستان فرستاده می‌شود تا به خانواده‌ای از مهمان‌داران که یک پروژهٔ گردشگری در لانهٔ گرگ، پناهگاه هیتلر در جنگ جهانی دوم، اداره می‌کنند، نفوذ کند. پس از اینکه فهمید پدر خانواده، ویلهلم رائوس، در مأموریتی برای برپایی رایش چهارم است، بکی دست به اقدام می‌زند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Now working as a field agent for the CIA, Becky is sent undercover to Poland to infiltrate a family of innkeepers running a tourist venture at The Wolf's Lair, Hitler's WWII bunker. After learning that the father, Wilhelm Reuss, is on a mission to bring about the Fourth Reich, Becky takes matters into her own hands.","tagline_en":"","runtime":89,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Jenn Wexler"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["GB","US"],"cast":[{"name":"Lulu Wilson","role":"Becky","photo":"/7qqMBuvdZoayPVmVZKHBLqUgKiJ.jpg"},{"name":"نیل پاتریک هریس","role":"General Wilhelm Reuss","photo":"/r2twLWLwDpKJ7JyhWsD1YsL7rJV.jpg","en":"Neil Patrick Harris"},{"name":"جیمز اوربانیاک","role":"Dr. Friedrich Metzger","photo":"/7KUK2x6OI5XdPX5xrYAo9hxL49Z.jpg","en":"James Urbaniak"},{"name":"کیت سیگل","role":"Agent Kate Montana","photo":"/jJJGmVKvMFHMJEwyfiHgxXEFePO.jpg","en":"Kate Siegel"},{"name":"Desmond Eastwood","role":"Agent Jeffrey Fox","photo":"/6C4AewNqq7gR7u1Odd4j7VKBtSI.jpg"},{"name":"براندون فلین","role":"Jordan Rigby","photo":"/2fir5bwu0nNB4FiQZYY5J9tWZqC.jpg","en":"Brandon Flynn"},{"name":"Catherine Walker","role":"Helga Reuss","photo":"/sWPaelbeMW1Z7ZGnXCsaRpJevW6.jpg"},{"name":"Noah Leggott","role":"Otto Reuss","photo":"/4yhD1OYVRhA93HzFFQUfVe5YuR6.jpg"},{"name":"Aoife Hughes","role":"","photo":"/sxtLQVJaqZZhCL5aCQdVYgN8rzy.jpg"},{"name":"Fiona Marr","role":"CIA Director Baker","photo":"/f9VnjxlfmInK0CDWUvvBqsbx3cR.jpg"},{"name":"Warren McCook","role":"Lab Brownie","photo":""},{"name":"Cathal J. Ferris","role":"Monitor Room Brownie","photo":""}],"trailer":"aQrxHLuqJCk","watch":{"US":{"link":"https:/